{"summary": "In this room, looking from the entrance, five wooden adjustable easels made with polished beech wood that are sturdy and smooth are arranged: adjustable easel 1 is placed 1 meter away from large drafting table 1, a gray tempered glass table that is spacious and smooth; adjustable easel 2 is positioned near rolling storage cart 1, a white powder-coated metal cart that is sleek and lightweight; adjustable easel 3 is adjacent to wall mounted drying rack 1, a white powder-coated wire rack that is functional and space-saving; adjustable easel 4 faces track lighting fixture 1, a black brushed aluminum fixture that is modern and minimalistic; and adjustable easel 5 is next to freestanding sculpture stand 1, a solid oak stand that is sturdy and versatile. Three white rolling storage carts are placed throughout: cart 1 is under track lighting fixture 2, cart 2 is beside the stainless steel utility sink that is durable and deep, and cart 3 is near the matte black ceramic kiln made with industrial-grade steel that is robust and heat-resistant. Four black track lighting fixtures illuminate key areas: fixture 1 shines on large drafting table 1, fixture 2 is directed towards the wooden canvas storage rack made with unfinished pine that is spacious and rustic, fixture 3 is above the white acrylic paint organizer made with molded plastic that is modular and stackable, and fixture 4 shines on wooden model stand 1, a beige birch plywood stand that is lightweight and smooth. Two large drafting tables are present: table 2 is accompanied by a silver metal stool made with stainless steel that is sleek and ergonomic, placed under it. Two wall mounted drying racks are mounted: rack 1 is near adjustable easel 3, and rack 2 is beside the matte black digital projector made with high-grade plastic that is compact and lightweight, which is mounted on the ceiling above large drafting table 2. Two clear glass palettes made with tempered glass that are smooth and easy to clean are placed: palette 1 is next to brass floor lamp 1, a polished brass lamp that is elegant and adjustable, and palette 2 is on rolling storage cart 2. Five freestanding sculpture stands are positioned: stand 2 is near the ceramic kiln, stand 3 is beside wooden model stand 2, stand 4 is adjacent to brass floor lamp 2, and stand 5 faces track lighting fixture 3. The wooden model stands are placed: stand 2 is near freestanding sculpture stand 3, and stand 3 is beside wall mounted drying rack 2. The brass floor lamps provide additional lighting: lamp 1 is next to glass palette 1, and lamp 2 illuminates freestanding sculpture stand 4."}
```

